    "xl": "24px",
    "stamp": "2px",
    "pill": "999px",
    "$note": "Controls stay tight, media goes generous. The contrast between a 6px button and a 16px photograph is a deliberate signal; one uniform radius everywhere is what reads as a template."
  },
